        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Victor Salva, Emilio Fernández\n- Works: Jeepers Creepers 2\n- Companies: American Zoetrope, Capitol Films, Myriad Pictures, United Artists, Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer\n- Roles: Film director, screenwriter, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Emilio Fernández was born as Emilio Fernández Romo on March 26, 1904, and he was a Mexican film director, actor, and screenwriter.\n- Victor Ronald Salva was born on March 29, 1958, and he is an American film director and screenwriter.\n- Jeepers Creepers 2 is a 2003 American horror film written and directed by Victor Salva.\n- Jeepers Creepers 2 was produced by American Zoetrope, Capitol Films, and Myriad Pictures.\n- Jeepers Creepers 2 was distributed by United Artists, which is a division of Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer.\n- Emilio Fernández died on August 6, 1986.",
